%% DPI Consent Manager: OTP delivery added to the existing OTP providers
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Partner as Partner / consent screen
  participant CM as Consent Manager
  participant Res as Phone resolver<br/>(owner-approved)
  participant OAN as OAN API
  actor F as Farmer
  Partner->>CM: POST /consent-requests (method otp) or resend-otp
  CM->>CM: provider.issue(): code, hash, 300 s expiry
  CM->>Res: phone for subject FIN
  alt no phone
    CM-->>Partner: 422 otp_destination_unknown (request refused)
  else phone found
    CM->>OAN: POST /messages/sms (otp, expires_at = code expiry)
    alt OAN refused / unavailable
      CM-->>Partner: 502 / 503 (request refused, ask again)
    else accepted
      CM-->>Partner: 201 / 200 (code never in the response)
      OAN->>F: SMS "OAN: 123456 is your code to allow <partner>..."
      F->>Partner: enters code
      Partner->>CM: POST verify-otp (consent granted)
    end
  end
